cription":"CH0079_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"我が演説を聞くが良い！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/0GMuqAltu9jZAUIUl2MoTwejf6onDkaa.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"ここにある品はすべて、我が万魔殿が用意したものだ。  ああ、我々に財力があるからこそ可能だったということだ。驚くのはまだ早いぞ、クックックッ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/RpjBHhm7EC5NUU5qce6HxyOVJI80By5q.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_2_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"ん?品はどうした?  キキキッ、もしかして、先生の目当てはこのマコト様のほうだったりするのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/Dtx6m15O4qNOWWzvViSKx7PYIJZIDRFh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_2_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"特に用はない……？……そうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/1gWPovpGl74UqQOBBfgrH0KczNHrwrmk.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_Buy_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"ほお、それを選ぶとは。その審美眼、高く評価してやろう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/8JHlF0ltg4HhcExaYuDtT9x93kNIx9db.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_Buy_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"それは私のおすすめだ キッキッキッ、いいものを選んだな","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/X6x9X5AHym9tDurxq2R9DOm4179dpqKG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_Buy_3_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"キキキ、今日の私は気分がいい おまけをつけてやろう！万魔殿の協力提案書だ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/HhYia4gRIUvHlMVTtY87nRFHIk6N95Od.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_Buy_3_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"……なに、いらない、だと? ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/tVAkimCS0ytZG2Q8g620gEzGijJEBm7Q.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_Buy_4","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"それが欲しかったのか、先生。  キッキッ、変わった人だな。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/y9szOAgruRMaDmy0jidPDkNSIQdAShGR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_End","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"キキ、残念だが、臨時店舗はここまでだ。 そう寂しい顔をするでない。 次は更に規模を拡張し、盛大かつ豪華に帰ってくるからな、キキキッ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/irgyW6X2E6zMCceCW6FdKhV8ZSvNpKfa.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_Login_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"ゲヘナの宴を記念し、特別に開店した店舗だ。 思う存分見ていくがいい、キキッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/BadSPTDPZHDMMW68cmckqnb4pH6I4t3u.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_EventShop_Login_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"誰かと思ったら、先生か。購入する品は、もう決めたのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/oXI2TT3ax5dJaYcAmijAPRvcxCFUmMqH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"キキキ! 撃てっ!  あれ? ギャ、逆!? ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/hw2u3IZwefDkqK2Cew6wkAENS0kjAZnN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"キキキ、全弾発射ッ!  ん?  はっ!  反対!? ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/gyeeg7w8jVSDU2F2urHM8xkF5PnNxmqd.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"行け!行け行け、キキキ!  え?こ、こっちじゃない? ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/FYSKgIgAXWisMtfn7TReeuMFJPq78WrF.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"うわああああああああああああ! ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/7G9AbuGd0wMvzpTFcKIf1E4ncoh7StEQ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"そ、そんなぁぁぁぁぁぁ!! ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/rmolWB5iZYlHFwjxZJOTxpnn29iwrCcY.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"う、うわー!ま、間違えたー! ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/2fOiL5Birc618AAebrM8p2ITFLdsIY1N.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"キ……キキ……キャヒャヒャヒャヒャ！ まったく、侮れないな、先生。こんなプレゼントを用意しているだなんて。 ……信頼の証として受け取っておこうじゃないか。これからも頼んだぞ、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/AZt17eJAB35PF54qElmnqPrg7ViXEgl1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"遂に降臨してやったぞ！ キキキッ、万魔殿の羽沼マコト様が直々に足を運んでやったのだ、手厚く歓待するが良い。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/DWrLVnu6Chwr5SQvjp6dvPXtqbiePgfH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"なるほど、指導者の極致に達したこの私にも、まだ成長の余地があったとはな。キキキ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/awK3ltqUc6rfAsqv1DQC0JQiD3q2oeVV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生からご支援いただけるとはな。ならば遠慮なく。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/oEYJ87JW3cx2DCrMwClQ88rv3td2zZAN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ほう、先生はずいぶんと期待してくれているのだな。  いいだろう、答えてやろうじゃないか。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/0DaSqwvQMESlz1ypOl13GTUhKAjFlQfI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"優秀な人材には、それ相応の报酬があって然るべき。  キキキ、当然のことだな。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/HHZzSz8QiRbyLv5WFviBvyCY2QFJ9CfH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"キキッ、まさかこの私が直々に当番を行う日がくるとはな。 まあ、雑務がキヴォトス征服計画に発展することも……十分に、あり得る。キキキッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/kvTRLYWBKFU2iTl6z0JoXOCpL6PkAQqL.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"有能な指導者であるマコト様が、先生の協力を得た日には…… もはや鬼に金棒、虎に翼だな！キキキッ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/WgpZKzPGjfCHRAIoZaopTsMTBIslOLP1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ふむ？今は急用があって、私の手伝いができない、だと？ キシシッ、案ずるな。先生の多忙具合は、理解しているぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/f7u9tFo09HaWpxldrhUVw7QRLm1T8skv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"時には、偉業よりもイブキのプリンの行方のほうが大事なときもある。 ああ……そういう日も、あるとも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/b9wKvS2zZrAg5u5J6Vexi6ue5OdJf8Qh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"キキッ、先生みたいな人は、初めてだ。 私の意見に賛同するわけでも、反対するわけでもなく、かと言って口出しもしてこない……。 ……実に、興味深い。クックックッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/1CNF6Q9bPZN0UZfFkuyrVOmz19Rzd9Cl.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"偉業は一夜にして成らず。マコト様は、絶対に諦めないからな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/8pntEWqvzRUArmO65FvSyfXWXgiR6r3N.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"いつか必ず、先生を私のものにしてみせよう。 今から覚悟しておくがいい、キキキッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/6cAxCcjkt8zOFO2Sji7Xx1SmW4Rpcdg7.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"やっと来たか、先生。 あんまり万魔殿のリーダーを 待たせるんじゃないぞ。  キキキッ、まあいい。 では、マコト様の 偉業の話をはじめよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/CvidIEI4RwWFXuIuxMNWpZRc08kXigSF.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"遅いじゃないか、先生。 ちょうどキヴォトス征服の 画期的な構想が 浮かんだところだ。  今から説明をする、 早く席につけ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/p16VILpjpOeuhe5Quv12qKguXpyBN3en.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"キシシッ、先生よ、活躍はみていたぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/x1ecsuRAGELEF6ZjkIjljs7DmMK8qfp6.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お前は他人を助け、事件を解決し……シャーレの名声を上げてきた！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/3eZejA5FgkAaUQN7lOGRCi9Ekpmzf0LR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"キキキッ、ここまできたら、 もはや認めざる をえないだろう――","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/9RBanVOp2PGYXXS0CiqmUX0OVDfM7Ngo.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"そう、お前がこのマコト様と 肩を並べるほどの、 実力者であるということを！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/tZJwsznCsbHpiqLnJkMzZAknfKl4fthr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"その能力を高く評価し…… 断れない重大な提案を しようじゃあないか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/DU75RoCiGcX3Sy5kEs0oXXtQ6LhH9ICc.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"シャーレの先生よ、 我が万魔殿と……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/HrrFWCckocjznlEPEMXDBKHfeSrD2EUq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"いや、この羽沼マコト様と 手を組め！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/sChxnrQSS0XHtmsY97lKoOV7P07aypaJ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"我々が力を合わせれば、 キヴォトスの征服など容易い！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/Kc8P5bc4SeOI9U5IOTp1xavhqR27iEWR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"もしもそうなったら、 キヴォトスの半分をシャーレに 渡すとしよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/0AeU0RDUGibSD3bcPgc6j0vuptbF2WRp.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"どうだ、悪くない 取引だろう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/F6WW4GflIMSitGCAr8LVGBpNqrYOjbgl.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"さあ！先生！この私と！ 遠大な夢を叶えようじゃないか！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/ioMrYHsQvmvPqAzc4tVB6aTrhJQI5S5O.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"キキキッ、キシシシシシシッ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/RJ4hX7rn7sAMaxabDLEMFAnET68lufdl.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"最近、先生との会話が楽しくなってきた気がするぞ。  くふふ、先生もそう感じているのではないか? ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/kI68HMRVsKRts7ZftX9vBSpGkBDmntGB.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ああ、先生、そこにいたのか。ちょうど暇ができたところだ。少しの间、歓談と行こうじゃないか。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/z9O0Bd88ziaJuGhIdYLLDyG3fRuERsjO.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"多忙な日々から離れ、ゆったり過ごす時間というのも悪くはないな。  キヘヘヘ、気に入った。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/N7gx2Elhqdw2ZNlzFBd2sXVZylpkdBRP.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ケッヘッヘッヘッ、この私をもっと頼っていいぞ、先生。私は万魔殿のリーダー、天下の羽马マコト様なのだからな！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/g045CQbhN2ACunDdH9EINoRCe7nLoR9r.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Season_Birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"マコト様の誕生祝い……？ クックック、分かってるじゃないか、先生！偉大なる指導者の生誕を讃えるのは、至極当然のこと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/avlIHdQKjg03qEzzmD9OZCS0klj3rKX2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生がそう言うのなら、続けようじゃあないか！ 今から、このマコト様の生誕祭を開くぞ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/pXgY8wsXjEqY4XQlIslnpKKbCL5kFAje.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ククッ……キキキッ…！話は聞いている、今日は先生の誕生日らしいな。 万魔殿主催で祝いのパーティを開いた。もたもたしている暇はない。行くぞ先生！キキキッ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/LlLxhpUVd6zNb7XVJcJwc6ziVo4Xf6fg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ハロウィーンか。 エイプリルフールの次に 気に入っている日だ。  いたずらが全面的に 許されるからな。  キッキッキッ、 先生も一緒にどうだ？ トリックオアトリート。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/mKF2kx2waOvMWg96CSGh9p4FBzSsVgNk.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あけましておめでとう。 年が明けたな、先生。  新たなキヴォトス 征服計画について 話し合おうじゃないか。  記念すべき新年初会議だ！ 遅れないように！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/5qYRaq7oo2yZ2xh4j3Y6UH7RZu3Hh5Jm.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Season_Xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"キキッ、 メリークリスマスだ、先生。  今日はソリに乗った怪人が マッハの速度で空を飛び、 良い子にプレゼントを ばら撒く日、だという。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/75JOQRntCKKT0tFVOlsHRWOSsO8EdBUn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Season_Xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"……負けるわけにはいかない。 今からイブキのプレゼントを 買いに出かけるぞ！  先生も一緒に行くか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/uUKyFIZOsLgQOctvcsifCLqMD9cTb1qL.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"キキキッ、ブルーアーカイブ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/A7jpadyIh9IPWyIYwYOp4uRt3h8PjW7T.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"シャーレ……キヒヒ、いつ见ても狭苦しい场所だな。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/XsMtIly9X0NPURiM7PV1wFU63GSyi1CG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0079_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"イブキの游び场を计画的に作らねば ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/wZPLqgnzSQy4zS9nSxvn1T0nVn6sDnhU.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"キッキッ、先生のお手並み拝見といこうじゃあないか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/jp/ch0079_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"この私に助けを乞うか？キキキッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/jp/ch0079_formation_in_1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0079_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"沙勒……嘻嘻，不管怎么看，都太狭小了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"必须给伊吹安排一个游乐场……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"得想办法抓到伊吕波那个家伙……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"希望皋月和千明没有翘班……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"这里的氛围挺不错的嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"好好听着！这可是我真琴大人的演讲！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_1","category":"event","text":"这里所有的东西，都是我们万魔殿准备的。没错，正是因为我们有雄厚的财力才能做到。你先别急着吃惊，这才哪儿到哪儿呢，呵呵呵。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_2_1","category":"event","text":"嗯？东西怎么了？嘻嘻嘻，难道老师的目标是真琴大人我本人吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_2_2","category":"event","text":"……没有事情找我……？……好吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_buy_1","category":"event","text":"哦，居然选这个啊。你的审美不错，我给予高度评价。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_buy_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_buy_2","category":"event","text":"这个我也很推荐。嘻嘻嘻，老师你挑到好东西了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_buy_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_buy_3_1","category":"event","text":"嘻嘻嘻，今天我心情不错，就多送你点东西吧！这是万魔殿的合作提案！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_buy_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_buy_3_2","category":"event","text":"……什么？不需要？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_buy_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_buy_4","category":"event","text":"你想要这个啊，老师。嘻嘻，真是个怪人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_buy_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_end","category":"event","text":"嘻嘻，很遗憾，临时商店要关门了。别那么失落嘛。下次我会扩大规模，以更隆重的形式华丽回归的，嘻嘻嘻！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_login_1","category":"event","text":"这是为了纪念歌赫娜宴会特别开设的商店。你可以随便逛逛，嘻嘻。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_login_2","category":"event","text":"……我还以为是谁呢，原来是老师啊。想好要买什么了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_eventshop_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"嘻嘻嘻，开火！……诶，什么，方向反了？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"嘻嘻嘻，全弹发射！……嗯？是、是反方向？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"开炮开炮开炮！嘿哈哈哈哈！诶？不、不是这儿吗？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"……呃、呃啊啊啊！！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"怎、怎么会这样！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"……搞搞搞、搞错啦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"嘻……嘻嘻……嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻！老师真是深藏不露啊，竟然准备了这样的礼物。……那我就当作信任的象征收下了。以后也多多指教了，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"时候终于到了！嘻嘻嘻，我，万魔殿的羽沼真琴大人亲自驾临，还不赶紧好好款待？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"没想到啊，在领袖之道上已登峰造极的我，竟然还有进步的空间！嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"竟然能得到老师的支援，那我就不客气了。嘻嘻。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"哦？看来老师对我充满期待呀。好，我就满足你的期待吧。嘻嘻嘻哈哈。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"对优秀的人才，应当给予相应的奖赏。嘻嘻嘻，这是理所当然的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻，没想到会有我亲自值日的一天。唔，从杂务发展到征服基沃托斯的计划……也是很有可能的。嘻嘻嘻。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"我真琴大人这个优秀的领袖，如果能得到老师的协助……简直就是锦上添花，如虎添翼啊！嘻嘻嘻！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？你是说现在有急事，没办法帮我？嘻嘻嘻，没关系，我知道老师经常很忙。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"有时候，比起我的伟业，伊吹布丁的下落更重要。嗯……确实也有这种时候。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻，我还是头一次碰到老师这样的人。对我的意见既不赞同也不反对，更不会干涉…………实在有趣，嘻嘻嘻。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"伟业非一蹴而就之物。我真琴大人是绝对不会放弃的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"总有一天，我会把老师收归麾下。你最好现在就做好心理准备。嘻嘻嘻！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"你终于来了，老师。别让万魔殿的领袖等太久啊，嘻嘻嘻。好，那就开始聊聊我真琴大人的伟业吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"你来得太晚了，老师。我正好有个关于征服基沃托斯的划时代构想。你快坐下，我现在就来给你讲讲。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻嘻，老师。我一直在关注你的活跃表现。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"你向他人伸出援手，解决了各种事件……让沙勒声名鹊起！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻嘻，这样一来，我也不得不承认──","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"没错，老师是足以跟我真琴大人相提并论的实力派！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"我很看好老师的能力……所以，我会向你提出一个你无法拒绝的重大提议。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"沙勒的老师，跟我们万魔殿……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"不，是跟我羽沼真琴大人联手吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"只要我们齐心协力，征服基沃托斯简直轻而易举！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"等到那时候，我就把基沃托斯的一半分给沙勒！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"怎么样，这个交易不错吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_4_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"来吧，老师！跟我一起实现这远大的梦想吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻嘻，嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"最近和老师聊天似乎越来越愉快了。嘻嘻，老师你难道不觉得吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"啊，老师，你在那儿啊。我正好有空，要来聊会儿吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"从繁忙的日常中抽身，悠闲地消磨消磨时间，似乎也不错呢。嘻嘻，我很喜欢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"嘻嘻嘻，你可以更依赖我一点，老师。我可是万魔殿的领袖，天下无敌的羽沼真琴大人！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"给真琴大人我庆祝生日……？嘻嘻嘻，你还挺有心的嘛！老师！为伟大的领袖庆生，是理所当然的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"既然老师这么说，那就继续吧！真琴大人的生日庆典现在开始！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻嘻……嘻嘻嘻……！听说今天是老师的生日啊。我们万魔殿给你开了庆生派对。没时间磨蹭了，快走吧老师！嘻嘻嘻！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻嘻，老师，新春快乐。怎么，很意外吗？伟大的领袖当然要做到通晓各种文化，才能与民同乐！……好了，别说这些了，该去陪伊吹放烟花了，老师也一起来玩吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节？这是我除了愚人节以外最喜欢的节日，因为可以尽情开玩笑。嘻嘻嘻，老师要不要一起来？不给糖就捣蛋。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"今天的月亮真圆哪，没有一丝缺口。等到征服全基沃托斯的日子到来时，我真琴大人统治的版图一定也会是如此一番美景吧！嘻嘻嘻！放心吧，老师，我会记得我们的约定的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新年快乐。又是一年过去了。要不要来聊聊征服基沃托斯的新计划？这可是值得纪念的新年首次会议！别迟到了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘻，圣诞快乐，老师。听说今天是乘坐雪橇的怪人以超音速在天空中飞行，给听话的孩子送上礼物的日子。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"……我可不能输。我现在就出门给伊吹买礼物去！老师要一起去吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_title","category":"lobby","text":"嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻……！Blue Archive！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/cn/ch0079_title.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_buy_3_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/ch0079_eventshop_buy_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_buy_3_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/ch0079_eventshop_buy_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_buy_4","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/ch0079_eventshop_buy_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_end","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/ch0079_eventshop_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_login_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/ch0079_eventshop_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_eventshop_login_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/ch0079_eventshop_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%BD%E6%B2%BC%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%B4/original/ch0079_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0079_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/stu